 <div className="invoice-total-preview"><span>Estimated total</span><strong>₹{(invoiceForm.items.reduce((n,x)=>n+Math.max(0,Number(x.quantity)||0)*Math.max(0,Number(x.rate)||0),0)*(1+Math.max(0,Number(invoiceForm.tax_percent)||0)/100)).toLocaleString('en-IN',{minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2})}</strong></div>
